# ThemeProvider

> Lede 0.8.0's docs for ThemeProvider, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/theme-provider.md

ThemeProvider sets scheme, contrast, accent, shape, density and glass for a subtree, and ThemeScope carries them into a portal. It also exports the accent `presets` and `pickOnColor`.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/theme-provider
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md), and the npm packages `@base-ui/react@^1.9.0`. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.8.0/theme-provider.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { ThemeProvider } from '@/components/lede/theme-provider';
```

